---
// Early Adopters Program section
---

<section id="early" class="py-20 px-4 bg-surface-alt">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal" data-reveal>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">Early Adopters Program</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 text-white">Sabemos lo que duele.<br/>Lo vivimos también.</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto">Si tu equipo usa Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot y tres herramientas más, y no tienes quién las gobierne — este programa es para ti.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-14">
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-7" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);" data-reveal>
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🎯</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">"Pago 4 herramientas distintas"</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">GitHub Copilot + CrewAI + Mem0 + Notion AI. Cuatro facturas, cuatro dashboards, cuatro equipos aprendiendo cosas distintas.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-green-accent text-sm font-medium">→ Una plataforma. Una factura.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-7" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="150">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🔒</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">"No sé qué datos pasan por AI"</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Tres developers metieron datos de clientes en ChatGPT. Sin audit trails, sin data residency, sin control.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-green-accent text-sm font-medium">→ Audit trails inmutables + on-prem option.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-7" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="300">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4">💸</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">"Cada equipo va por su lado"</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Engineering usa Copilot, Support usa Zendesk AI, Ops scriptea con Python. Zero coordinación, zero memoria compartida.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-green-accent text-sm font-medium">→ Memoria cross-team. Gobierno centralizado.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Package card -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);" data-reveal>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-8">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">Paquete Early Adopter</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4 text-white">Tu empresa primero. Siempre.</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-accent mt-0.5">🎁</span>
              <div><strong class="text-white">Pricing legacy:</strong> Team plan a $29/mes (vs $49) por 12 meses.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-accent mt-0.5">🎁</span>
              <div><strong class="text-white">Onboarding VIP:</strong> Setup asistido por nuestro CTO. SSO listo en 24h.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-accent mt-0.5">🎁</span>
              <div><strong class="text-white">Shape the roadmap:</strong> Votación prioritaria. Canal privado con founders.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-accent mt-0.5">🎁</span>
              <div><strong class="text-white">3 meses gratis:</strong> Control plane completo. Sin compromiso.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-accent mt-0.5">🎁</span>
              <div><strong class="text-white">Certified Early Adopter:</strong> Badge público para tu empresa.</div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-full md:w-72">
          <div class="rounded-xl p-5 text-center" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent">47</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">de 100 slots reservados</div>
            <div class="mt-3 h-2 bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full w-[47%] bg-accent rounded-full"></div>
            </div>
            <a href="#waitlist" class="mt-4 block w-full bg-accent hover:bg-blue-500 text-white py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/25 active:scale-[0.98]">Apply for Early Access</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
